{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB上位小生吳偉豪出身小康之家，近日他罕有拍片分享家中大屋，令超巨型後花園曝光。</p><p>片中他以白色T恤、黑色短褲配波鞋，一身貼地「街坊裝」出鏡，在大屋外的後花園打理，見走廊及牆頭擺滿密密麻麻的盆栽，數量多得驚人，吳偉豪則逐一照料，先提起大水桶，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T12:00:23.214062+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T11:02:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T11:54:03.740918+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T11:54:03.740918+00:00","content_hash":"530da7f0859ca3ab9c70a6337d96e93baa4822f9243d0ce261362d201bb016aa","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}